# ==============================================================================
# UPMIND Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env.local or .env for local development
# Note: .env.local and .env are git-ignored to prevent accidental key leakage
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CLIENT CONFIGURATION (Browser & Mobile App Safe)
# Obtain these from: Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Modern publishable convention (Recommended):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key-here

# Compatible standard fallbacks (supported interchangeably by UPMIND):
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key-here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. SERVER-ONLY CONFIGURATION (Privileged - NEVER EMBED IN CLIENT OR APK)
# Configure these in Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > Edge Functions
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-secret-service-role-key-never-share
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-ai-key-for-learning-coach
